This license governs the "Covered Work", which is:

  (a) every file in any of the following directories and all of their
      subdirectories:
        - `pipelines/chunking/` — the chunking orchestrator, the form
          detector, the chunking skill registry code, the individual
          chunking skills, and the evaluator;
        - `config/chunking/`   — the form taxonomy / form registry, the
          routing and chunking policy, the skill lifecycle policy, the
          quality-scoring weights, and the skill overrides;
        - `registry/chunking/` — the skill table of contents, the skill
          knowledge-graph index, the approved-skills list, and the
          contract lock;
      together with all related source code, schemas, and configuration; and

